Source: nvidia-graphics-drivers-legacy-96xx
Section: non-free/x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Debian NVIDIA Maintainers <pkg-nvidia-devel@lists.alioth.debian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>> 4.0.0), sed (>> 3.0)
Standards-Version: 3.6.2


Package: nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx-ia32
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nvidia-kernel-legacy-96xx-#VERSION#, ia32-libs, ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: nvidia-settings, nvidia-kernel-legacy-96xx-source (>= #VERSION#)
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx-ia32
Replaces: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx-legacy-ia32, nvidia-glx-legacy-71xx-ia32
Description: NVIDIA binary Xorg driver (96xx legacy version)
 These Xorg binary drivers provide optimized hardware acceleration of
 OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server. AGP, TV-out and
 flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 Please see the nvidia-kernel-legacy-96xx-source package for building the kernel module
 required by this package.

Package: nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx
Architecture: i386 amd64
Depends: nvidia-kernel-legacy-96xx-#VERSION#, x11-common (>= 7.3+2), xserver-xorg-core (>= 2:1.4)${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: nvidia-settings, nvidia-kernel-legacy-96xx-source (>= #VERSION#)
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx-legacy-dev, nvidia-glx-legacy-71xx, nvidia-glx
Provides: xserver-xorg-video-2
Replaces: nvidia-glx-src, nvidia-glx-legacy
Description: NVIDIA binary Xorg driver (96xx legacy version)
 These XFree86 4.0 / Xorg binary drivers provide optimized hardware 
 acceleration of  OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server. 
 AGP, PCIe, SLI, TV-out and flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 This legacy version supports:
 GeForce2 MX/MX 400, GeForce2 MX 100/200, GeForce2 Go, Quadro2 MXR/EX/Go
 GeForce4 MX 460, GeForce4 MX 440, GeForce4 MX 420,  GeForce4 MX 440-SE
 GeForce4 440 Go, GeForce4 420 Go, GeForce4 420 Go 32M,  GeForce4 460 Go
 Quadro4 550 XGL, GeForce4 440 Go 64M, Quadro NVS, Quadro4 500 GoGL, 
 GeForce4 410 Go 16M, GeForce4 MX 440 with AGP8X, GeForce4 MX 440SE with AGP8X
 GeForce4 MX 420 with AGP8, GeForce4 MX 4000, Quadro4 580 XGL, 
 Quadro NVS 280 SD, Quadro4 380 XGL, Quadro NVS 50 PCI,
 GeForce2 Integrated GPU, GeForce4 MX Integrated GPU, GeForce3, 
 GeForce3 Ti 200, GeForce3 Ti 500, Quadro DCC, GeForce4 Ti 4600
 GeForce4 Ti 4400, GeForce4 Ti 4200, Quadro4 900 XGL, Quadro4 750 XGL,
 Quadro4 700 XGL, GeForce4 Ti 4800, GeForce4 Ti 4200 with AGP8X, 
 GeForce4 Ti 4800 SE, GeForce4 4200 Go, Quadro4 980 XGL, Quadro4 780 XGL,
 Quadro4 700 GoGL, 
 .
 Please see the nvidia-kernel-legacy-96xx-source package for building the kernel module
 required by this package.
 
Package: nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx-dev
Architecture: i386 amd64
Depends: nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx (>= #VERSION#)
Provides: libgl-dev
Conflicts: nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx (>= #NEXTVER#), libgl-dev, mesa-common-dev, nvidia-glx-legacy-71xx-dev, nvidia-glx-dev
Replaces: libgl-dev, nvidia-glx-legacy
Description: NVIDIA Xorg driver development files (96xx legacy version)
 This package contains the NVIDIA binary Xorg driver
 development files.
 .
 For more information on this source package visit NVIDIA's homepage
 at http://www.nvidia.com/ .

Package: nvidia-kernel-legacy-96xx-source
Architecture: i386 amd64
Depends: debhelper (>> 4.0.0), make, sed (>> 3.0), dpatch (>= 2.0.0)
Recommends: nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx (>= #VERSION#), kernel-package (>= 8.082), devscripts
Conflicts: nvidia-kernel-src, nvidia-kernel-legacy-source
Replaces: nvidia-kernel-src, nvidia-kernel-legacy-source
Description: NVIDIA binary kernel module source (96xx legacy version)
 This package builds the NVIDIA Xorg  binary kernel module 
 needed  by nvidia-glx-legacy-96xx. 
 The drivers provide optimized hardware acceleration 
 of OpenGL applications via a direct-rendering X Server AGP,
 PCIe, SLI, TV-out, and flat panel displays are also supported.
 .
 PLEASE read /usr/share/doc/nvidia-kernel-legacy-96xx-source/README.Debian 
 for building  information.
 .
